Model
-----

The deployment format and runtime are designed for weights derived from
"Sabir-20M: A Turkish Micro Language Model" by jetbabareal (2025):
https://huggingface.co/jetbabareal/Sabir-20M

The Hugging Face model card labels Sabir-20M as MIT licensed. At the time this
notice was prepared, the model repository did not expose a separate LICENSE
file. Model weights are not distributed in this source repository. Users who
download or redistribute derived weights must review the upstream repository's
then-current terms themselves.

Reference implementation acknowledgement
