esp32-ai is Copyright (c) 2026 Viacheslav Sierbov and is distributed under the
MIT License. Its Per-Layer Embeddings architecture is not used in this port.

Training data
-------------

The Sabir-20M model card describes approximately 1.5 million tokens of Turkish
dialogues but does not provide enough source and license detail for this project
to make a legal-compliance representation about the training corpus.

